  controlled and authorized environment
- 100% responsible disclosure, no disruption to live systems
- Clear risk prioritization enabling focused remediation
- Findings converted into actionable remediation steps

# technical approach
- Scoping & authorization — explicit testing boundaries and constraints
- Attack surface analysis — exposed services, auth flows, entry points
- Vulnerability discovery & validation — manual + tool-assisted testing
